{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43296","headline":"泗滨得石磬 · 李勳","name":"泗滨得石磬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮磬潜清深，依依呈碧浔。\n出水见贞质，在悬含玉音。\n对此喜还叹，几秋还到今。\n器古契良觌，韵和谐宿心。\n何爲值明鉴，适得离幽沈。\n自兹入清庙，无复泥沙侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}